```python
def generate_grafana_panel_url(panel_base, minutes=30):
    """Return Grafana URL for last N minutes."""
    end = int(datetime.datetime.utcnow().timestamp() * 1000)
    start = end - (minutes * 60 * 1000)
    return f"{panel_base}?from={start}&to={end}"
```

