## 🧩 1️⃣  `terraform-deploy.yml` — Infrastructure as Code Pipeline

```yaml
name: Terraform Deploy

on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
    paths:
      - 'infrastructure/**'
  workflow_dispatch:

jobs:
  terraform:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    permissions:
      id-token: write
      contents: read

    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Setup Terraform
        uses: hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3
        with:
          terraform_version: 1.7.0

      - name: Terraform Init
        working-directory: infrastructure
        run: terraform init

      - name: Terraform Plan
        working-directory: infrastructure
        run: terraform plan -out=tfplan

      - name: Terraform Apply
        if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'
        working-directory: infrastructure
        run: terraform apply -auto-approve tfplan
```

✅ **Deploys:** S3, Redis, RDS, Lambdas, IAM roles, and networking.

